# Settings > Updates P2 (report 047): what stops or ends an install, on a release build 0.8.12 (arm64) offered 0.8.13:
#   1. the helper refused (its plan needs install.sh by hand: a desktop was installed): "0.8.13 not installed: see Show
#      log", "Last update  not installed"
#   2. a battery board at 30 % that is not charging (D16): Install says so, nothing is downloaded
#   3. a download whose checksum does not match: "Damaged download (checksum): try again", the file deleted
#   4. an update interrupted (the status says running, its helper is gone: a power cut): "Repair the update" and
#      "Update to 0.8.13 interrupted: Repair it"
# Review only: no golden.
title updates failure
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
# P3: no Store backend here: the "App updates" row (a thread that reads the catalogue) stays out of this scene, so a shot
# never depends on when that thread ends; the System packages scan is held (apt board pending): its row says "checking"
env HARNESS_APPS missing
apt board pending
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-04
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.8.12 release arm64
update answer releases-0.8.13.json
update download done
update helper state refused
update helper step plan
update helper from 0.8.12
update helper to 0.8.13
update helper started now-600
update helper updated now-590
update helper reason needs install.sh by hand: a desktop was installed: the launcher would move to the desktop variant
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 1000
key ENTER
wait 300
# 1. refused
shot updates_refused
expect_text "0.8.13 not installed: see Show log"
expect_text "not installed"
# 2. the battery
update battery 30
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 400
shot updates_battery
expect_text "Battery 30 %: charge it or plug it in"
expect_text "Install 0.8.13"
# 3. a damaged download
update battery none
update checksum bad
key ENTER
wait 1200
shot updates_damaged
expect_text "Damaged download (checksum): try again"
# 4. interrupted
update helper state running
update helper step install
update helper-alive off
key UP
key UP
key ESC
wait 300
key ENTER
wait 1500
shot updates_interrupted
expect_text "Repair the update"
expect_text "Update to 0.8.13 interrupted: Repair it"
